+## Local network access
+
+Responses include a `Permissions-Policy` header allowing this application's origin
+to request resources on the user's local network and loopback interface. Both the
+`local-network` and `loopback-network` directives and the legacy
+`local-network-access` directive are included for browser compatibility.
+
+Serve the application over HTTPS (or localhost during development). Users must
+grant the browser's network access permission when prompted, and local services
+must allow the application's origin through CORS for cross-origin requests.
+See the [Local Network Access specification](https://wicg.github.io/local-network-access/).
+
